196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (To all incoming students, welcome into your first year at the University of Pittsburgh! We at the National Society of Black Engineers - Pitt Chapter \(Pitt NSBE\) are here to provide community, mentorship, professional development opportunities, and support as you progress through your first year here. And to all of our returning members, welcome back! We hope to continue to be a space that you can trust and rely on. Be sure to stick with us to see all of the exciting things we have planned for this year! Follow our Instagram @PITT_NSBE and our website pittnsbe.org as we continue to post updates!)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5 391 0 R 7]
>>
endobj
