198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (Throughout the start of the semester, our Top 5 has been interviewing applicants to work in our Freshman Representative program, providing freshmen with an opportunity to experience a leadership position and learn more about our E-Board. The Top 5 have officially selected the new Freshman Representatives for the 2026 - 2027 academic year! Thank you to everyone that applied! Keep a close eye out to our Instagram \(@PITT_NSBE\) later this month for an introduction to everyone on our E-Board!)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
199 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (Our Mentor-Mentee program is also officially underway! Mentees have been paired with their mentors, so keep an eye out for official Mentor-Mentee events!)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
