/P 185 0 R
/E (Following this month, take all the skills that you have learned and apply it in the Fall Regional Conference, November 6 - 8! This year, the Fall Regional Conference will be held in The Westin Pittsburgh! Expect fun and engaging workshops, connections with other NSBE chapters within the region, and opportunities to network with career professionals!)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [11]
>>
